            "articleId": "kodistill",
            "blockId": "[null,1]",
            "anchor": null,
            "quote": "Small vision-language models can answer a question about an image without reliably transcribing its Korean text. KoDistill-VL explores that gap: start with a bilingual Qwen3.5-2B fine-tune, add literal Korean text recognition, and measure both Korean gains and English changes.",
