            "anchor": "merging-lora-weights",
            "quote": "With PR #1364, we added new methods for merging LoRA weights together. This is not about merging LoRA weights into the base model. Instead, this is about merging the weights from different LoRA adapters into a single adapter by calling add_weighted_adapter. This allows you to combine the strength from multiple LoRA adapters into a single adapter, while being faster than activating each of these adapters individually.",
